      "content": "it really feels like more than just a \"possibility\" though. like, when i look at the timing of it and how it spreads, it doesn't feel organic. it feels like it's being pushed to certain groups of people specifically. can you look into the psychological patterns of how these things go viral? i want to see if there's a logical way to identify if other \"trends\" are actually just baseline tests for how much people will tolerate before they push back.",
